@engineering.solid

Purpose:
  Object oriented design principles.

Principles:
  srp:
      Single responsibility.

  ocp:
      Open for extension, closed for modification.

  lsp:
      Liskov substitution.

  isp:
      Interface segregation.

  dip:
      Dependency inversion.

UseWhen:
  - object oriented design
  - maintainable code
  - extensible systems

AvoidWhen:
  - trivial scripts
  - functional-first approach

Why:
  Foundation of maintainable OOP design.

Related:
  @engineering.dependency-inversion
  @engineering.composition-over-inheritance

Examples:
  @project.payment
  @project.order

State: +
